{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "bfcaa281895aa774fc3707917986d7b4ff310558860a4d2ad52dfd6d877188d9", "ja": "導かれるままに", "zh": "顺从指引", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9531d5bb4026353232a3d0eca3c8409e0176ee6f7a6861df720330fc45390299", "ja": "第六幕も無事千秋楽を迎え、打ち上げは翼と\nひなたが紬のために考えたデートコースに。\nオシャレなりんご飴を見つけたアイドル達は\n早速プランが崩れてしまうが、それもまた\nよしと休日を満喫するのだった。", "zh": "第六幕也顺利迎来了千秋乐，庆功宴变成了翼和日向为紬精心安排的约会路线。偶像们发现了时髦的苹果糖后，计划很快就泡汤了，不过这样也不错，她们就这样尽情享受着假日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b597569185073cf2167fc02dba3f2cb211799e8750d1b46046ec8231a8e69ade", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第六幕は千秋楽を迎えた。\nそれぞれの演技が、今まで以上に光っていたな）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第六幕迎来了千秋乐。大家的演技都比以往更加出彩）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "51595854f7faf18851a301e577d075bf1b2825627d5aedead73e9e9012dba51b", "ja": "（そして今日は、翼とひなたが紬のために\n考えたというデートコースに付き合うことになった）", "zh": "（然后今天，我要陪翼和日向为紬设计的约会路线走一趟。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "f705bde6eb9d28a7c522d93753e578cf1bc71e104d9c47cf6bcfbd5b5bc1d129", "ja": "翼ちゃんが選んでくれた、このモール……\nかなりハイカラな場所だねぇ。", "zh": "小翼选的这家商场……真是个相当时髦的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "24149665b9aa8ff3fea7daf416edf08548ff188da79decef0985f3fa9d4f37cf", "ja": "ううん、圧倒されてる場合じゃないべさ。\n主演を務めた紬さんを、ちゃぁんと労らないと！", "zh": "不对，现在可不是被镇住的时候。\n必须得好好慰劳担任主演的紬小姐才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1ce3fd4a60bbe29dce0158ed373221cfa406b5fcaa306ddb0df771e915d3c6a2", "ja": "そうそう！　せっかくふたりで考えたんだもん♪\n先に、お店の場所確認しておこっか？", "zh": "对对！难得是我们两个人一起想的嘛♪\n先去确认一下店的位置吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7165225bc5e711c72dd41dca0913a93b1bcd575dd26ca2686980950aa4558ef3", "ja": "えーと、最初はお昼ご飯食べるから、\nあっちのエスカレーターで……。", "zh": "嗯～首先要去吃午饭，所以从那边的自动扶梯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "117231f5489ac44a4a38294e3b629572d0c62e060d2cb32df91cf7781321628c", "ja": "翼ちゃん、あたしも行くよぉ。\n{$P$}、ちょっと見てくるねえ。", "zh": "小翼，我也去哦。\n{$P$}，我去看看哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "05332bb277c9aaabbcd791cd3b6973735062c26da98fcc12e43a7e91d1620f3b", "ja": "ああ、頼んだ！", "zh": "啊，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "e301eb7d13d121af79c33cdca949f0630aa326422eb4c590c38a902fc7f562e4", "ja": "ふたりとも、他にもお客さんがいるんだから\n走っちゃダメだぞー？", "zh": "你们两个，现场还有其他客人，不能跑哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5ed29fce64609c8584ccdb595d3944b584066e8baf8e9e1534b3b8c55fbae7d1", "ja": "……あの、福田さん。\n今回は本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "……那个，福田小姐。\n这次真的非常感谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "588ca6803d188987e8118baf14ea0a2d2dc683bd3584adf41624470e679fd1a9", "ja": "クロエという役を乗りこなせたのは、\n福田さんのおかげに他なりません。", "zh": "能够驾驭好克洛伊这个角色，全都多亏了福田小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "2ba65636688f8140ed886a91edafbfb463642fe4aa5747ff9375a5051e9a3d4f", "ja": "紬……も、もー！　おおげさだよ！\nアタシはただ、話を聞いただけだし。", "zh": "紬……真是的！你太夸张了！我只是听你说了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c081a5d1c2e5ca615a7128e664ac0358c89acbd7be763add6838b2650dbdf50b", "ja": "ですが、それに助けられましたから。本当に、劇場の\nみなさんは、いろんなことに気付かせてくれて……。", "zh": "但是，我确实因此得到了帮助。剧场的大家……真的让我意识到了很多事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b969edf5497516db99c6b774ed333e85c8e31f05d5a21e1fda6f8f7fef4a5757", "ja": "あの……また、私がなにかに悩んだ時は……\nバイクの後ろに乗せてくれますか？", "zh": "那个……如果我以后又有什么烦恼的时候……\n能让我坐你的摩托车后座吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "85624721f4c65ec94adb706ff38ec5ff62f6d325dc85e38a66f0b5349df175c4", "ja": "もちろん！\n悩んでなくたって、いつでも大歓迎だよ！", "zh": "当然啦！\n就算你没有烦恼，随时都欢迎你坐上来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9b6233ff3cce0c2f709cd336f260cab8ed4a4bfa364df26fee9a81d34d1e3875", "ja": "ひなたちゃん大変！　あそこで、\nすっごいオシャレなりんご飴売ってる！", "zh": "日向，不得了！那边在卖超时髦的苹果糖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "fe2cf8ec3a188c736e3e76acdebb12f83f16b997fd2a93c810c0c4174782447f", "ja": "すっごいオシャレなりんご飴……！？\nそ、それは気になるねぇ。", "zh": "特别时髦的苹果糖……！？\n这、这可真让人在意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "9bc29562783254be6c5e0e01bf1dc9626040eb909848ba69973021865718ce1b", "ja": "でも、すごい行列じゃないかい？\nあれに並んでいたら、この後の計画が……。", "zh": "不过，那队伍也太长了吧？\n要是排在那里，接下来的计划就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ba0ca6ef01be4840eacfa26c67d36f214c48bb733add9a0ef5439697e99d2160", "ja": "う～……でもあれ持って写真撮りたいよね？\nデートプラン、いきなり崩れちゃうかも～！？", "zh": "呜～……可是，还是想拿着那个拍照吧？\n约会计划可能要一下子泡汤了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4ebff987974e08264390397dd145b9ae7c8967a87731e1572873c5a6fcb5392f", "ja": "ふふ……大丈夫ですよ、並びましょう。おふたりが\n案内してくださる場所が、今日の行き先です。", "zh": "呵呵……没关系，我们排队吧。两位要带我们去的地方，就是今天的目的地。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4505621784061154ac6ca2f615175a6f17f2523c74a6433a9479fa991890842f", "ja": "それに……私も、興味があります。\nすっごいオシャレな、りんご飴に。", "zh": "而且……我也很感兴趣。\n对那种特别时髦的苹果糖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "cc62ad2e9d610c732b9163f18b13896ae830241a04fa1e177b43d3cc4544cf63", "ja": "紬さん……。\n本当かい？", "zh": "紬小姐……\n真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "288822c1eff2d1717cabdcf9dc645c24b12f90997a4e24962084db589f0fda67", "ja": "紬もこう言ってることだし、早速並びにいこう！　\nほら、こうしてる間にも列が長くなってるし……。", "zh": "既然紬都这么说了，我们马上去排队吧！\n你看，就在我们说话的这会儿，队伍也越来越长了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "c9e6352dd494cd9078826e9ad28f326c2d241bd00c9838d9e39d4c14b6db2ec2", "ja": "アタシ、ちょっと先に並びにいってくる！", "zh": "我先去前面排队啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00fe6d88094293c308002c9f2e56cfa23bda8c835a7a33bd26c20d3a7ee5f9a5", "ja": "あっ、のり子さん待って！\nわたしも一緒に行きますってば～！", "zh": "啊，德利子小姐，等等！\n我也一起去嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c17e62548cd8dd3fbcfec9bcb8f79403bff8ad21145fbc19d28fa91a40f40491", "ja": "ふふ。私たちも行きましょうか、\n木下さん。", "zh": "呵呵，我们也一起走吧，木下小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "bf039fa8deb21fd3e73f030c404b3ee44ebe5d84a297d7139a752afb74925a6a", "ja": "そうだねえ、紬さん。", "zh": "是啊，紬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "75ed9ce1077ea4aed9dc546de4156453259ff3a5b2a2353048a4d14cb8beab96", "ja": "みんな、慌てて転ばないようにな！\n……よし、俺も追いかけるか……。", "zh": "大家，可别慌慌张张摔倒了啊！\n……好，我也追上去吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "99b53fd4c13e477b2567704def19282ed1290f334fd76ebac23420ce65643639", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』も佳境……。\nここからまた、さらなる展開が待ち受けている……）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》也进入了高潮……从这里开始，又有更加跌宕的展开在等待着我们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "27b4c09773e20cb2f78a36d1d5c3a202316b8ab133c8d391e068854307bb1dec", "ja": "（どんな大きな波が来ても振り落とされないよう、\nアイドル達と共に、突き進んでいくしかないな！）", "zh": "（不管多大的浪潮袭来，为了不被甩下去，\n也只能和偶像们一起奋勇向前了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
